// MRE base configuration example. No credentials are included.
// Copy the relevant lines to Servers/MRE/Server/Commands.dat after first launch.
// This file does not configure plugins, MAX4, loot, autosave, or donation delivery.
// Gameplay settings belong to the generated Servers/MRE/Config.txt.
Name MRE #1 | PEI | Survival | MAX4 | RU
Map PEI
Mode Easy
MaxPlayers 24
Perspective Both
Port 27015
// Add a password during closed testing:
// Password REPLACE_WITH_PRIVATE_TEST_PASSWORD
// Add your private token for public listing, generated for Steam app 304930:
// GSLT REPLACE_WITH_PRIVATE_TOKEN
// Add the owner only after replacing the placeholder with the actual SteamID64:
// Owner REPLACE_WITH_OWNER_STEAMID64
